          <h1 class="sv-hero-h1">Supervision</h1>
          <p>Supervision offers a confidential space to reflect on professional situations: decisions, your own role and how you work with others. The aim is to safeguard the quality and success of your work and to shape it in a way you can sustain. Along the way, new perspectives and options for effective professional action emerge.</p>
