          <div class="rd-clamp rd-worum-text rd-text">
            <div class="rd-eyebrow">Supervision</div>
            <h2 class="rd-h2">What it is about</h2>
            <p>Supervision is a pause from day-to-day work, a chance to look at it together from above. The &ldquo;House of Supervision&rdquo; and its &ldquo;glass floor&rdquo; illustrate this: from a little distance, we look at everyday work. In a confidential setting, the dynamics of professional situations become easier to understand, and new perspectives and options for action emerge.</p>
            <p>It is also about your own role, your collaboration with others and easing the strain of demanding work situations. Successful supervision helps you build professional skills, handle tasks more effectively and find more satisfaction in your work.</p><button class="rd-readmore" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="faq-toggle"></span><span class="rd-readmore-t">Read more</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
