          <div class="rd-fcards sv-step-cards">
            <div class="rd-fcard">
              <button class="sv-format-head" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><div class="sv-format-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.4"/><path d="M5 20v-1.2A4.8 4.8 0 0 1 9.8 14h4.4A4.8 4.8 0 0 1 19 18.8V20"/></svg></div><h3>Individual supervision</h3><span class="faq-toggle sv-fc-toggle"></span></button>
              <p>Focuses on your personal goals, helps clarify your professional role and supports the development of professional skills. It can also address personal and biographical themes that affect working life.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rd-fcard">
              <button class="sv-format-head" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><div class="sv-format-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="4.4" cy="7.2" r="2.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="6" r="2.5"/><circle cx="19.6" cy="7.2" r="2.2"/><path d="M1.4 15v-.8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V15"/><path d="M8.6 15v-1.1a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 6.8 0V15"/><path d="M16.6 15v-.8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V15"/><path d="M1.5 18h21"/><path d="M5 18v3"/><path d="M19 18v3"/></svg></div><h3>Team supervision</h3><span class="faq-toggle sv-fc-toggle"></span></button>
              <p>Aims to improve collaboration and communication, since team members rely on each other to get their work done. Often it is about improving workflows and clarifying responsibilities, and resolving conflicts is part of it too.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rd-fcard">
              <button class="sv-format-head" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><div class="sv-format-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="7" cy="8" r="2.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="2.8"/><circle cx="17" cy="8" r="2.6"/><path d="M2.8 20v-.8a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 3.8-3.8h1a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 2 .58"/><path d="M14.4 15.98a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 2-.58h1a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 3.8 3.8v.8"/><path d="M8.6 20v-.6a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 3.4-3.4 3.4 3.4 0 0 1 3.4 3.4v.6"/></svg></div><h3>Group supervision</h3><span class="faq-toggle sv-fc-toggle"></span></button>
              <p>Supports exchange among professionals from different teams or fields of work who face similar questions. Participants benefit from the expertise and experience of the other group members as well as from the group process itself.</p>
